From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:22:15 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Copy voice pass, batch 2: rewrite all 26 hotspot cards

Deluxe Reverb, 1968 Twin and Tweed Deluxe explorer cards in the approved
voice. Evidence limits are stated once per card in the fine-print note.
Attribute rows, sources, photos and anchors are unchanged. Tweed Deluxe
cards draw attributed analysis and owner lore from the 5E3 research
packet; see docs/handoff/COPY_VOICE.md for flags.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ACvL11Kej7Bsqu5jPvgEE4
